{"title": "Illithid Expertise", "pageid": 18878, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Illithid_Expertise", "categories": ["Passive features", "Illithid Powers"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Illithid_Expertise.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Illithid_Expertise.webp/300px-Illithid_Expertise.webp, /w/images/6/68/Illithid_Expertise.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Illithid_Expertise.webp/300px-Illithid_Expertise.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Illithid_Expertise.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Illithid Expertise</b> is a passive feature and <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid Power\">Illithid Power</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Partial-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Partial-Illithid\">Partial-Illithids</a>. This feature gives a character <a href=\"/wiki/Expertise\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Expertise\">Expertise</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Intimidation\" title=\"Intimidation\">Intimidation</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Checks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Checks\">Checks</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have deepened your sense of self, gaining Expertise in Persuasion, Deception, and Intimidation Checks. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>After becoming a <a href=\"/wiki/Partial-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Partial-Illithid\">Partial-Illithid</a>, unlock from the <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid power</a> skill tree with a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen</a> after obtaining one of the following:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms\" title=\"Luck of the Far Realms\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp/25px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp/38px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp/50px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Luck of the Far Realms\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp/25px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms\" title=\"Luck of the Far Realms\">Luck of the Far Realms</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fracture_Psyche\" title=\"Fracture Psyche\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Fracture_Psyche_Icon.webp/25px-Fracture_Psyche_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Fracture_Psyche_Icon.webp/38px-Fracture_Psyche_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Fracture_Psyche_Icon.webp/50px-Fracture_Psyche_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fracture Psyche\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Fracture_Psyche_Icon.webp/25px-Fracture_Psyche_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Fracture_Psyche_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fracture_Psyche\" title=\"Fracture Psyche\">Fracture Psyche</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>It is not necessary to have proficiency in any of these skills beforehand.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194952\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 886/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7167/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3245/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643530/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.192      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   29.192      1 -total\n 39.75%   11.605      2 Template:SAI\n 36.20%   10.567      2 Template:Icon_link\n 34.79%   10.157      2 Template:Icon_text\n 30.09%    8.783      4 Template:Trim\n 23.91%    6.979      2 Template:Ifempty\n 16.41%    4.790      1 Template:PageSeo\n 15.37%    4.488      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.23%    3.570      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:18878-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714194952 and revision id 171938. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}